T BoundingStructure                 | SpatialSubdivision.h | 77-157  | owning                        | -  | Extents over one occupant's faces, in that occupant's own object space. subdivision over every face would be re-derived whenever any occupant moved, and moving an occupant is the most frequent thing an artist does to a scene. convention. Two triangulations of one n-gon would classify its interior differently along the diagonal.
    has   Records            std::vector<BoundingRecord>     [-]  ?
